"gloss":"I"}],"gloss":"I"},{"surface":"அறி","parts":[{"text":"அறி","lemma":"aṟi","gloss":"know"}],"gloss":"know"},{"surface":"அளவையோ","parts":[{"text":"அளவை","lemma":"aḷavai","gloss":"measure"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ō","gloss":"clitic of emphasis/wonder"}],"gloss":"the measure indeed"},{"surface":"இவ்வே","parts":[{"text":"இவ்வே","lemma":"இவ்வே","gloss":"these indeed"}],"gloss":"these indeed","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வானத்து","parts":[{"text":"வானத்து","lemma":"வானத்து","gloss":"of the sky"}],"gloss":"of the sky","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வயங்கி","parts":[{"text":"வயங்கி","lemma":"vayaṅki","gloss":"having shone"}],"gloss":"shining"},{"surface":"தோன்றும்","parts":[{"text":"தோன்றும்","lemma":"tōṉṟum","gloss":"appearing"}],"gloss":"appearing"},{"surface":"மீனினும்","parts":[{"text":"மீன்","lemma":"mīṉ","gloss":"star"},{"text":"இனும்","lemma":"iṉum","gloss":"than"}],"gloss":"than the stars"},{"surface":"இம்மென","parts":[{"text":"இம்","lemma":"im","gloss":"onomatopoeic sound of swiftness/buzzing"},{"text":"என","lemma":"eṉa","gloss":"saying/like"}],"gloss":"swiftly/with a buzz"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பரந்து","parts":[{"text":"பரந்து","lemma":"parantu","gloss":"having spread"}],"gloss":"spreading"},{"surface":"இயங்கும்","parts":[{"text":"இயங்கும்","lemma":"iyaṅkum","gloss":"moving"}],"gloss":"moving"},{"surface":"மாமழை","parts":[{"text":"மா","lemma":"mā","gloss":"great"},{"text":"மழை","lemma":"maḻai","gloss":"rain/cloud"}],"gloss":"great rain clouds"},{"surface":"உறையினும்","parts":[{"text":"உறை","lemma":"uṟai","gloss":"raindrop"},{"text":"இனும்","lemma":"iṉum","gloss":"than"}],"gloss":"than the raindrops"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உயர்ந்து","parts":[{"text":"உயர்ந்து","lemma":"உயர்ந்து","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மேந்தோன்றிப்","parts":[{"text":"மேந்தோன்றிப்","lemma":"மேந்தோன்றிப்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பொலிக","parts":[{"text":"பொலிக","lemma":"பொலிக","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நும்","parts":[{"text":"நும்","lemma":"நும்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நாளே","parts":[{"text":"நாளே","lemma":"நாளே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"Like the serpent world, the canopy-filled earth / even if it is their own, will not go with them / even if they are empty people, it will remain for those who did penance / to the accepting brahmins, to fill their wet hands / pouring flowers and gold along with water / held in golden vessels by women wearing fresh jewels / drinking clarified wine filtered through fiber, with abounding joy / bestowing rare ornaments unstintingly to the suppliants / living is needed in these allotted days here / other than the good deeds done to live / at the time of sinking, there is no other raft / practicing the one truth, the self-controlled twice-born ones / resembling the three ritual fires, sitting beautifully to behold / O victorious, white-umbrellaed, flagged-chariot kings! / This is the measure that I know: / than the stars that appear shining in the sky, / than the raindrops of the great rain clouds that spread and move swiftly, / rising high and appearing above, may your days flourish indeed!","translation":"Even if this canopy-filled earth, vast like the sky, is entirely theirs, it will not go with them when they depart. Even if they are empty people who possessed nothing, it will remain for those who performed penance. Therefore, pour gold and flowers with water to fill the wet hands of receiving Brahmins. Drink the fiber-filtered clarified wine held in golden vessels by women wearing fresh jewels, and rejoice. Bestow rare ornaments unstintingly upon suppliants. In these limited days allotted to us in this world, we must live thus. When we sink, there is no other raft than the good deeds we have done while living. O victorious kings of flagged chariots and white umbrellas, who sit together beautifully to behold, resembling the three sacred fires of the self-controlled, twice-born Brahmins who practice the single truth! This is the measure of my knowledge: may your days rise high, shine above, and flourish more than the stars that appear in the sky, and more than the raindrops of the great clouds that spread and move swiftly!","modern":"வானத்தைப் போன்ற பரந்த இந்த உலகம் உங்களுடையதாகவே இருந்தாலும், நீங்கள் இறக்கும் போது அது உங்களுடன் வராது. ஒன்றுமில்லாத ஏழைகளாக இருந்தாலும், தவம் செய்தவர்களுக்கே இவ்வுலகம் நிலைத்து நிற்கும். எனவே, தானம் ஏற்கும் அந்தணர்களின் ஈரமான கைகளில் நீர் வார்த்து, பூவையும் பொன்னையும் சொரிந்து தானம் செய்யுங்கள். புதிய அணிகலன்களை அணிந்த பெண்கள் பொற்கலங்களில் ஏந்தித் தரும் வடிகட்டிய தெளிந்த மதுவை உண்டு மகிழுங்கள். இரவலர்களுக்கு அரிய அணிகலன்களைக் குறைவில்லாமல் வாரி வழங்குங்கள். நமக்கு வகுக்கப்பட்ட இந்தச் சில நாட்களில் நாம் இவ்வாறு வாழ வேண்டும். நாம் பிறவிக்கடலில் மூழ்கும் போது, நாம் செய்த நல்வினைகளைத் தவிர வேறு துணைக் கலம் இல்லை. ஒப்பற்ற உண்மையை உணர்ந்து அடக்கத்துடன் வாழும் அந்தணர்களின் மூன்று வேள்வித் தீயைப் போல அழகாக வீற்றிருக்கும் வெற்றிக் குடையும் கொடித்தேரும் உடைய மூவேந்தர்களே! நான் அறிந்த அளவு இதுவே: வானத்தில் விளங்கும் விண்மீன்களைக் காட்டிலும், பரந்து செல்லும் மேகங்கள் பொழியும் மழைத்துளிகளைக் காட்டிலும், உங்களுடைய வாழ்நாட்கள் உயர்ந்து விளங்கிப் பொலிவுறட்டும்!","explanation":"In this famous poem, the great poet Avvaiyār addresses the three crowned kings of the Tamil land (Chera, Chola, and Pandya) who are sitting together in unity. She compares their rare and majestic gathering to the three sacred fires maintained by self-controlled Brahmins. She advises them that earthly sovereignty is transient; even if they rule the entire world, it will not accompany them after death. Only the good deeds they perform will act as a saving raft when they sink in the end. Therefore, she urges them to enjoy their wealth by drinking fine wine served by jeweled maidens, giving gold and flowers to Brahmins, and generously distributing rare ornaments to suppliants. She concludes with a grand blessing, wishing that their days of glory may outnumber the stars in the sky and the raindrops that fall from the clouds.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.8],[0.8,0.9],[0.9,1.4],[1.4,1.4],[1.4,3.1],[3.1,3.2],[3.2,3.6],[3.75,4.8],[4.8,5.2],[5.2,5.45],[5.45,6.2],[6.2,7.1],[7.1,7.3],[7.3,7.7],[7.7,8.2],[8.2,9.5],[9.5,9.8],[9.8,10.6],[10.6,10.8],[10.8,12.1],[12.1,12.2],[12.2,12.7],[12.7,13.6],[13.6,14.7],[14.7,15.1],[15.1,15.5],[15.5,15.8],[15.8,15.8],[15.8,17.4],[17.4,17.8],[17.8,18.1],[18.1,18.5],[19.52,20.22],[20.22,20.52],[20.52,20.62],[20.62,20.82],[20.82,21.22],[21.22,21.92],[21.92,22.22],[22.22,22.22],[22.22,22.82],[22.82,23.92],[23.92,24.03],[24.25,24.47],[24.58,25.02],[25.02,25.92],[25.92,26.32],[26.32,26.32],[26.32,27.0],[27.0,27.42],[27.42,28.17],[28.32,28.72],[28.72,28.72],[28.72,29.12],[29.12,30.22],[30.22,30.62],[30.62,30.7],[30.7,30.72],[30.72,32.12],[32.12,32.32],[32.32,32.52],[32.52,32.92],[32.92,33.32],[33.32,34.62],[34.62,35.02],[35.02,35.22],[35.22,35.52],[36.64,37.24],[37.24,37.44],[37.44,37.74],[37.74,38.24],[38.24,39.44],[39.44,40.24],[40.24,40.64],[40.64,40.74],[40.74,40.94]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.1],[1.1,1.5],[1.5,2.0],[2.5,3.0],[3.0,3.1],[3.1,3.5],[3.69,5.0],[5.0,5.4],[5.4,6.0],[6.0,6.5],[6.5,7.6],[7.6,7.9],[7.9,8.2],[8.2,8.9],[8.9,10.3],[10.3,10.7],[10.7,11.5],[11.5,11.7],[11.7,13.0],[13.0,13.2],[13.2,13.7],[13.7,14.6],[14.6,15.8],[15.8,16.2],[16.2,16.6],[16.6,17.0],[17.0,17.1],[17.1,18.8],[18.8,19.3],[19.3,19.7],[19.7,20.3],[21.4,22.2],[22.2,22.5],[22.5,22.7],[22.7,22.9],[22.9,23.4],[23.4,24.6],[24.6,24.9],[24.9,25.0],[25.0,25.6],[25.6,26.23],[26.23,26.54],[26.54,26.85],[26.85,28.1],[28.1,29.1],[29.1,29.5],[29.5,29.5],[29.5,30.36],[30.36,30.9],[30.9,31.41],[31.67,32.19],[32.19,32.7],[32.7,33.2],[33.2,34.2],[34.2,34.7],[34.7,34.8],[34.8,35.08],[35.08,35.13],[35.13,35.3],[35.3,37.3],[37.3,37.5],[37.5,37.9],[37.9,39.3],[39.3,39.8],[39.8,40.2],[40.2,40.5],[41.76,42.36],[